%N A398410 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} H(k) * H(k/2) / k^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and H(x) is the harmonic number for the real value x.
%C A398410 See A074599 and A350670 for the value of H(x) at half integers.
%H A398410 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.7.6, pp. 351-351, eq. (4.154).
%H A398410 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harmonic_number#Harmonic_numbers_for_real_and_complex_values">Harmonic number: Harmonic numbers for real and complex values</a>.
%H A398410 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398410 Equals 97*zeta(4)/16 - 21*log(2)*zeta(3)/8 + 3*log(2)^2*zeta(2)/4 - log(2)^4/8 - 3*Li_4(1/2).
%e A398410 3.385872002208216169372122071262152782695406495633155...
